<title>FRANCE: Renault nine-month turnover 135.8 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Renault nine-month turnover 135.8 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover				    135,778    vs  136,999</p>
<p>    Third Quarter				41,693    vs   40,791</p>
<p>Nine month divisional breakdown:</p>
<p>     Automobile				  107,862    vs  106,307</p>
<p>     Commercial Vehicles			21,752    vs   24,240</p>
<p>     Finance					 6,164    vs    6,452</p>
<p>Third quarter divisonal breakdown:</p>
<p>     Automobile				   33,329    vs   31,642</p>
<p>     Commercial				    6,358    vs    7,065</p>
<p>     Finance					 2,006    vs    2,084</p>
<p>NOTE - Renault said in a statement that on a comparable basis the consolidated revenues for the third quarter of 1995 came in at 40,182 million francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
